<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's unemployment rises to 8.7 pct in Dec.</title>
<headline>Sweden's unemployment rises to 8.7 pct in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in Sweden rose to 8.7 percent in December from 7.9 percent in November, Statistics Sweden said on Friday.</p>
<p> SWEDISH UNEMPLOYMENT	 Dec 96     Nov 96     Dec 95</p>
<p> Percent of workforce	 8.7	   7.9	   7.8</p>
<p> Number of unemployed	 371,000     336,000     332,000</p>
<p>Note - A Reuters poll of economists showed the market had expected an unemployment rate of 8.1 percent in December.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
